Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:09.00,overtake - staff,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}本字幕由悠哈璃羽字幕社製作，僅用於日語交流使用\N請勿私自二次上傳及用作商業用途
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:17.00,overtake - staff,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}翻譯＆校對：阿羅雙車退賽笑哈哈  時後：萌新時刻準備擺爛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.27,0:00:10.41,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,春永先生  你沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:11.84,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,能聽見嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.84,0:00:14.13,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,春永先生  能動嗎  能聽見嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.54,0:00:17.42,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,春永先生  春永先生
Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,——OP——
Comment: 0,0:04:19.34,0:04:21.34,overtake op jp,,0,0,0,template char,!retime("line",-300,50)!{\pos($scenter,$smiddle)\an5\1a&Hff\3a&HFF\4a&HFF\t(!$scenter-($sleft/2)!,!$scenter-($sleft/2)+50!,\1a&HFF\3a&H00\4a&H00)\t(!$scenter-($sleft/2)+200!,!$scenter-($sleft/2)+300!,\1a&H00\3a&Hff\bord0\4a&H00)}
Comment: 0,0:04:19.34,0:04:21.34,overtake op cn,,0,0,0,template char,!retime("line",-300,50)!{\pos($scenter,$smiddle)\an5\1a&HFF\3a&HFF\4a&HFF\t(!$scenter-($sleft/2)!,!$scenter-($sleft/2)+50!,\1a&HFF\3a&H00\4a&H00)\t(!$scenter-($sleft/2)+200!,!$scenter-($sleft/2)+300!,\1a&H00\3a&Hff\bord0\4a&H00)}
Comment: 0,0:00:54.49,0:01:01.05,overtake op jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,Blowing in the wind… waiting for the time to start…
Comment: 0,0:01:01.05,0:01:07.64,overtake op jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,急な雨に遭って　水平線は煙った
Comment: 0,0:01:07.84,0:01:14.19,overtake op jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,見果てぬ　夢のかたちも
Comment: 0,0:01:15.97,0:01:22.66,overtake op jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,欠けたなにかを　それでも抱く期待を
Comment: 0,0:01:22.82,0:01:28.73,overtake op jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,この手に　離さぬままで
Comment: 0,0:01:29.12,0:01:35.62,overtake op jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,通り過ぎてく曖昧な毎日も　かけがえのない
Comment: 0,0:01:35.71,0:01:38.57,overtake op jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,軌跡だって　もう知ってるから
Comment: 0,0:01:38.57,0:01:46.01,overtake op jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,待ち続けるより　手を伸ばせば　そこに未来
Comment: 0,0:01:46.01,0:01:53.38,overtake op jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,さあ　どんな今日にさえ　明日が来て　僕ら進んできただろう
Comment: 0,0:01:53.55,0:02:00.98,overtake op jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,曇天の日々だって　終わりが来て　青天がのぞくだろう
Comment: 0,0:02:00.98,0:02:08.35,overtake op jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,声なき声が今も聞こえている
Comment: 0,0:02:08.53,0:02:16.28,overtake op jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,名もなき風が髪を揺らす
Comment: 0,0:00:54.49,0:01:01.05,overtake op cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,無論今天如何  明天依舊到來  我們仍會前進
Comment: 0,0:01:01.05,0:01:07.64,overtake op cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,突然降下的雨  讓地平線模糊不清
Comment: 0,0:01:07.84,0:01:14.19,overtake op cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,一併模糊了那未曾實現的夢想
Comment: 0,0:01:15.97,0:01:22.66,overtake op cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,即便缺少了什麼  但也依然抱有期待
Comment: 0,0:01:22.82,0:01:28.73,overtake op cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,緊緊抓著這雙手一刻不曾放開
Comment: 0,0:01:29.12,0:01:35.62,overtake op cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,共同度過的曖昧每一天  同樣不可缺少
Comment: 0,0:01:35.71,0:01:38.57,overtake op cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,往後的軌跡  其實早已知曉
Comment: 0,0:01:38.57,0:01:46.01,overtake op cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,與其一直等待  不如伸手去觸及未來
Comment: 0,0:01:46.01,0:01:53.38,overtake op cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,無論今天如何  明天依舊到來  我們仍會前進
Comment: 0,0:01:53.55,0:02:00.98,overtake op cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,陰翳的日子總會過去  之後便是晴天
Comment: 0,0:02:00.98,0:02:08.35,overtake op cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,不曾發出的聲音  如今也已經知曉
Comment: 0,0:02:08.53,0:02:16.28,overtake op cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,那沒有名字的風  吹動著你的頭髮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.63,0:02:27.55,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,還好春永沒事啊  撞車撞得這麼嚴重
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.66,0:02:31.43,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,才不是沒事啦  早月他都骨折了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.65,0:02:34.45,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我是指還好他只是骨折
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.77,0:02:38.55,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那個情況  說不定會有更嚴重的後果呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.69,0:02:43.22,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但是他暫時沒法回到賽車場了…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.70,0:02:47.19,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,這個賽季估計很難再繼續跑了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.40,0:02:56.08,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,真是的  別哭啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.58,0:02:57.81,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.26,0:03:05.42,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,話說  你既然這麼擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.66,0:03:07.37,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,就去探望一下他唄
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.75,0:03:09.73,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,探望？誰去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.76,0:03:12.88,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我去？不行不行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.88,0:03:15.17,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,要是可以的話我就不會這麼煩惱了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.17,0:03:18.70,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我根本不知道該跟他說什麼好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.95,0:03:21.89,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,雖然平時也不知道說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.82,0:03:24.96,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,你不是想支持他嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.27,0:03:27.10,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,直接告訴他不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.95,0:03:31.56,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,直接  直接…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.74,0:03:34.96,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,就是這樣就是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.40,0:03:37.41,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我每次都這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.06,0:03:39.34,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,怎麼了  錮太
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.57,0:03:41.04,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.75,0:03:48.05,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,話說  錮太你收到聯繫了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.71,0:03:50.93,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,聯繫？誰的聯繫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.03,0:03:52.54,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,孝哉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.37,0:03:54.86,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,啊  小真賀嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.98,0:03:57.41,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,話說最近沒跟他聯繫啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.01,0:04:01.48,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,從什麼時候開始的？我想想…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.48,0:04:03.86,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,上次比賽結束之後就一直沒聯繫
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.38,0:04:05.12,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,悠你也是？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.52,0:04:05.89,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.59,0:04:07.93,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.78,0:04:11.24,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那之後他也沒到這裡來過
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.85,0:04:14.81,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我說悠  那時候的事你跟他道歉了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.26,0:04:16.55,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那時候？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.68,0:04:18.42,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,之前比賽前開的小會
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.22,0:04:21.48,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,你們不是有點吵起來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.06,0:04:25.04,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,才沒有…吵架
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.73,0:04:28.57,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那就讓我看看你們都說了什麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.57,0:04:29.34,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,為啥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.45,0:04:32.94,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,畢竟是悠你  肯定回信息也像個刺頭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.23,0:04:33.86,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,等下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.66,0:04:35.17,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\fs35\pos(822,56)}太遠了不過來也行的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.66,0:04:35.17,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\fs35\an7\pos(1100,90)}就算多遠我也會去的！\N我會火速完成工作趕過去！\N我可以去帳篷那邊嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.66,0:04:35.17,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\fs35\an7\pos(948,220)}可以啊\N  隨你喜歡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.66,0:04:35.17,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs35\pos(1076,320)}謝謝你  \NF4排位賽結束後我應該\N就能過去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.66,0:04:35.17,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\fs35\an7\pos(1006,444)}排位賽辛苦了！\N我也過去帳篷那邊了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.66,0:04:35.17,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs35\pos(1078,546)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.66,0:04:35.17,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\fs35\pos(1088,684)}比賽前的事抱歉了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.27,0:04:35.74,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,3分
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.89,0:04:36.79,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,為什麼啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.91,0:04:39.86,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不過就悠來說也算是夠直率了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.95,0:04:43.38,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但是一直還是未讀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.29,0:04:46.13,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,你好  這裡是小牧Motors
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.60,0:04:49.26,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,你好你好  一直以來受你關照了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.96,0:04:52.44,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,對的  對的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.31,0:04:55.39,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,哈？怎麼這麼突然
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.23,0:04:58.53,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,什麼都決定了  那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.96,0:05:02.70,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,叔叔？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.06,0:05:04.15,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,發生什麼了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.79,0:05:07.53,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,三日月飲料那邊…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.26,0:05:11.55,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,撤回贊助到底是怎麼一回事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.78,0:05:14.78,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,小牧Motors的表現一直在變好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.06,0:05:17.41,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,這麼下去肯定有希望獲得勝利的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.65,0:05:18.44,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,拜託了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.56,0:05:19.91,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那個  等下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.03,0:05:21.75,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,如果原因是之前那次退賽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.75,0:05:24.55,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那都是因為我覺得狀況危險才阻止他們的  所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.55,0:05:25.41,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.28,0:05:29.20,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不是這樣的  真賀先生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.67,0:05:34.92,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,抱歉我來遲了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.90,0:05:38.52,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,這件事就由我來說明吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.86,0:05:42.93,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,真賀孝哉先生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.75,0:05:48.05,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,以前是用雪平孝哉這一名字來進行工作的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.35,0:05:51.94,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,真賀先生所拍攝的  悠的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.31,0:05:56.76,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,發布那張照片之後  我們公司收到了好幾宗質詢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.41,0:06:05.88,overtake newspaper,,0,0,0,,{\fs95\an7\frz40.28\pos(-34,590)}為了拍攝照片見死\N不救？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.41,0:06:05.88,overtake newspaper,,0,0,0,,{\an7\frz40.28\pos(217.6,497.2)}攝影師\N雪平孝哉的真面目
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.75,0:06:00.38,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,詢問三日月飲料是否僱傭了了十年前震災時
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.76,0:06:05.72,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,進行非人道行為的人來拍攝廣告照片
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.36,0:06:08.10,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,拍攝這張照片的人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.00,0:06:12.75,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,真賀先生  是你沒錯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.55,0:06:15.43,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.58,0:06:19.73,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但是  悠跟這件事沒有任何關係
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.10,0:06:21.26,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,如果問題在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.61,0:06:24.03,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那我保證今後不會參與任何貴社的廣告
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.38,0:06:26.46,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,所以  贊助方面還請您…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.01,0:06:26.79,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,{\an8}真賀先生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.15,0:06:32.59,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,現在還未引起大的騷動
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.87,0:06:35.54,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但要是被媒體盯上  引起大騷亂
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.86,0:06:37.65,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,這可是事關弊公司的形象的負面事件
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.99,0:06:45.63,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,真是十分抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.98,0:06:49.77,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,等下等下  雪平小姐請你抬起頭來啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.03,0:06:52.18,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不  這次的事歸根結底
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.34,0:06:58.55,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,原因都是我沒有跟三日月飲料說明清楚真賀的經歷
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.35,0:07:02.53,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那個  那之後真賀有聯繫你們嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.77,0:07:04.53,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不…沒有跟我聯繫
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.93,0:07:09.53,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,真是十分抱歉  本來他應該要跟我一起來才對
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.69,0:07:13.64,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,沒辦法啦沒辦法啦  他現在應該很自責吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.18,0:07:19.61,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,話說回來那張震災的照片  沒想到拍攝的人是真賀啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.63,0:07:24.27,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,確實引起過一番騷動  我看見照片就回想起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.80,0:07:27.77,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,當時電視節目上狠狠抨擊了他一整天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.99,0:07:28.80,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,這麼嚴重嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.96,0:07:34.96,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,說什麼倫理之類的  有拍照的時間為什麼不去救她什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.08,0:07:40.04,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,哈？那個情況下  就算不拍照也救不到那個女孩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.30,0:07:42.32,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,真是光憑一張嘴說
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.52,0:07:45.84,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但那確實是一張引發了如此衝擊的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.34,0:07:50.26,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,事關人命  那就更加如此了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.12,0:08:05.96,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\fs70\an7\frz6.009\1c&H18161D&\move(970,156,934,-70,1615,1823)}可以啊  \N隨你喜歡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.12,0:08:06.17,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\fs70\an7\frz6.009\1c&H18161D&\move(1266,504,1182,-62,1740,1990)}謝謝你  \NF4排位賽結束後我應該\N就能過去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.88,0:08:06.46,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\fs70\an7\frz6.009\1c&H18161D&\move(978,824,856,-104,63,480)}排位賽辛苦了！\N我也過去帳篷那邊了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.00,0:08:08.13,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\fs70\an7\frz6.009\1c&H18161D&\move(1490,1000,1368,86,0,360)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.08,0:08:08.13,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\fs70\an7\frz6.009\1c&H18161D&\move(1068,1036,980,340,0,322)}比賽前的事抱歉了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.21,0:08:08.13,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\fs70\an7\frz6.009\1c&H18161D&\move(962,1018,922,676,0,192)}錮太和叔叔都很擔心你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.59,0:08:09.98,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,悠
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.47,0:08:51.07,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,車手衝線
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.26,0:08:57.09,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,第一名是Belsorriso的新任一號車手  德丸俊軌
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.85,0:09:11.77,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那麼  一起祝賀德丸先生的一號車手揭幕戰以及首個冠軍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.05,0:09:13.45,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,乾杯！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.65,0:09:15.56,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,乾杯！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.29,0:09:17.65,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,{\an8}恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.32,0:09:19.66,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,{\an8}辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.79,0:09:20.27,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,結谷前輩您也是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.36,0:09:23.69,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,二號車手揭幕戰拿到第三名  真是恭喜你了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.75,0:09:24.97,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,謝謝了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.20,0:09:27.77,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,哎呀  我有一瞬間還以為自己不行了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.12,0:09:29.65,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,沒想到運氣這麼好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.29,0:09:32.06,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,真是差一點啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.19,0:09:33.20,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,運氣好？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.05,0:09:38.20,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,真厲害  你是靠運氣才站上頒獎台的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.36,0:09:39.60,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不…那個
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.18,0:09:41.05,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,十分抱歉！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.84,0:09:44.14,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,開玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.36,0:09:46.95,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,畢竟我也一樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.48,0:09:51.34,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,要是早月沒有受傷  今天我也不會作為一號車手出戰了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.54,0:09:54.19,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,真是漂亮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.19,0:09:55.76,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,是啊  德丸果然很厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.75,0:09:57.21,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.75,0:10:00.18,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,今天完全是我的調校有問題
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.57,0:10:01.92,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,錮太你沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.31,0:10:04.39,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,是我說要減少練習時間的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.80,0:10:07.57,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,減少練習  調校肯定會變得更難做的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.53,0:10:13.60,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,要不還是恢復以前的練習時間？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.86,0:10:15.60,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,輪胎也還有些富餘…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.60,0:10:16.32,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.85,0:10:17.66,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.66,0:10:18.74,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,沒問題的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.25,0:10:21.31,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,沒有贊助的時候也一直這麼過來的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.90,0:10:24.98,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,前段時間只是偶爾運氣好而已
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.90,0:10:33.61,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.90,0:10:35.75,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,看見悠了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.19,0:10:39.68,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,去送晚報了  說今天開始繼續打工了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.29,0:10:41.49,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.68,0:10:42.16,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.33,0:10:46.06,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我在想我們這樣子真的好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.26,0:10:46.87,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,你指什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.44,0:10:51.83,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,怎麼說呢  已經見到了一次
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.29,0:10:55.10,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,看到了悠表現這麼出色的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.63,0:11:01.01,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,讓人忍不住就產生期待了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.74,0:11:03.69,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,會遐想很多事情啊  更好的成績
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.44,0:11:07.19,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,雖然這都是我自私的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.16,0:11:10.22,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不過這種事情…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.99,0:11:12.80,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.27,0:11:14.02,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,歡迎回來
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.89,0:11:16.76,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,歡迎  我說悠
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.31,0:11:17.66,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,錮太
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.80,0:11:19.42,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,跟你說點事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.63,0:11:22.97,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,給
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.29,0:11:26.97,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那是什麼事？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.23,0:11:32.15,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不…就是找你商量點事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.70,0:11:34.05,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.93,0:11:37.71,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,其實我也有點事想跟你說
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.05,0:11:38.55,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.79,0:11:42.10,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,你先說啦  是你叫我來聊聊的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.97,0:11:44.38,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,是之前比賽的事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.41,0:11:47.84,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不是  是關於那傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.93,0:11:50.58,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那傢伙？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.02,0:11:54.78,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,孝哉  還是一直聯繫不到他
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.74,0:11:58.18,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.21,0:12:02.23,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,是因為贊助商的事還在自責消沉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.62,0:12:05.24,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,其實我根本不覺得那是小真賀的錯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.09,0:12:06.46,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.78,0:12:10.33,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,話說  錯的是當時亂說話的那群人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.56,0:12:12.25,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,可惡的偽君子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.72,0:12:16.98,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那傢伙  可能又拍不出照片了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.44,0:12:22.21,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.16,0:12:25.07,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,是我的錯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.00,0:12:27.67,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我是知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.90,0:12:28.55,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.32,0:12:30.39,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那張照片的事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.81,0:12:35.10,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,知道那傢伙以前發生過什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.05,0:12:39.02,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,而我卻自認為了解他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.68,0:12:41.39,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但其實我完全不懂他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.70,0:12:45.04,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,要是我能早一些調查照片的事就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.69,0:12:53.32,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那樣就能更加了解他  更加了解他所說的事情了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.25,0:12:57.55,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,為什麼我總是事後才明白
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.02,0:12:58.95,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,真是糟透了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.85,0:13:02.12,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,這樣就跟老爸那時候一樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.94,0:13:08.02,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,想太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.71,0:13:10.12,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,哈？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.16,0:13:14.18,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,你想太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.17,0:13:23.41,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,話說  要是想了這麼多  那直接跟他說不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.89,0:13:26.74,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但是…我也聯繫不上他
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.92,0:13:29.04,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,向冴小姐問他的住址
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.46,0:13:32.23,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但是…但是我該說什麼好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.23,0:13:36.38,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,真是的  把剛才你說的話直接告訴他不就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.25,0:13:39.77,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,哎  好像這話我之前也說過
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.40,0:13:44.50,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,話說  錮太你想說的是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.77,0:13:46.30,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,之後再跟你說
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.48,0:14:22.75,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,終終終終於來探望早月了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.06,0:14:24.85,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,怎麼辦怎麼辦  我該說什麼好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.85,0:14:27.54,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,雖然小錮太說  我直接跟他說那些話就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.54,0:14:30.22,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但直接是怎麼直接？怎麼樣直接
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.60,0:14:34.56,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,{\an8}好開心  謝謝你們
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.99,0:14:35.94,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,好  排好隊哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.75,0:14:39.02,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,早月  我想要兩張呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.02,0:14:41.20,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那就重新排隊啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.46,0:14:43.20,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,好好  別吵架啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.69,0:14:45.57,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我會按順序給你們簽名的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.40,0:14:48.65,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不過每人一天只能拿一張哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.09,0:14:52.32,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,想要第二張的話就請明天再來哦  明白了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.47,0:14:53.71,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.71,0:14:55.30,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,什  什…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.73,0:14:58.99,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,什麼情況啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.42,0:15:00.93,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,早月  再見了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.03,0:15:02.27,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,明天我也會來哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.53,0:15:04.68,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,好  回家注意安全哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.47,0:15:10.60,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不知不覺就暴露了我在哪個醫院了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.17,0:15:16.65,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不過沒想到不在比賽出場也有人給我加油  真是令人感激
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.82,0:15:20.14,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,是啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.84,0:15:24.56,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那個  這是慰問品
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.68,0:15:26.94,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,是水果  謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.09,0:15:29.76,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不不  只是些簡單的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.97,0:15:32.97,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,欸  我喜歡蘋果  我好開心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.35,0:15:39.38,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,你比想像中的要精神呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.49,0:15:41.76,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,嗯  只是骨折而已
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.00,0:15:43.24,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,完全沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.33,0:15:45.53,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,好疼…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.09,0:15:47.77,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不能勉強自己哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.77,0:15:50.79,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,肋骨和左腳要三個月才會完全恢復呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.80,0:15:54.73,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不過骨折好了之後我打算立馬就回歸賽場
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.05,0:16:01.71,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但是醫生叮囑說  一發現我勉強自己就要延長住院時間呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.24,0:16:04.72,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,哎  好想趕緊復健啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.86,0:16:06.72,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,好想活動活動身體啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.23,0:16:11.88,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那你平時都做什麼呢…請問
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.25,0:16:13.39,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不用說敬語啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.20,0:16:15.66,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我想想  平時啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.99,0:16:23.57,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,跟粉絲女孩子聊天  給粉絲女孩子簽名  跟粉絲女孩子打牌
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.84,0:16:26.76,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,還有看F4的比賽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.81,0:16:32.70,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,之前的比賽你去了嗎  很精彩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.96,0:16:35.60,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,阿俊作為一號車手獲勝了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.50,0:16:36.98,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.31,0:16:44.47,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那個  但是我…沒有早月的比賽…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.47,0:16:47.55,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,沒有我的比賽也跑得相當好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.41,0:16:50.19,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.19,0:16:52.51,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,嚇了一跳呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.72,0:16:57.17,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我還想要趕緊回歸賽場呢  看來也不用了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.54,0:17:00.99,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,是因為天才不在了  給車隊帶來危機感了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.65,0:17:06.85,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,還是說  其實沒有我也完全沒所謂呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.13,0:17:08.23,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,才沒有這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.23,0:17:10.95,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,哎呀  我的運氣也到頭了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.24,0:17:12.21,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,開玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.12,0:17:25.45,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,還沒走嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.69,0:17:27.31,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,笑生先生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.65,0:17:28.45,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,很用心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.52,0:17:31.72,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,抱歉  擅自用了這個房間
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.20,0:17:33.06,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.62,0:17:36.20,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,怎麼了  有什麼在意的事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.74,0:17:41.30,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.06,0:17:44.32,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,結谷有一瞬間掉到了第五位
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.77,0:17:50.20,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,雖然在下一個彎反超回來了  但那只是因為前面的車失誤了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.56,0:17:52.20,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,並不是因為他速度快
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.40,0:17:53.72,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,真嚴格啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.04,0:17:57.88,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,哪裡嚴格了  如果我是二號車手  絕對不會犯這種錯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.43,0:18:01.43,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但目前已經沒有我這個水平的車手了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.82,0:18:03.43,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,他們不符合我們的要求
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.17,0:18:07.71,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,別這麼說嘛  你也可以給他們一些建議的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.59,0:18:12.25,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,笑生先生  我十分感謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.88,0:18:18.61,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,如果我沒被Belsorriso選上  我現在估計已經放棄賽車了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.42,0:18:28.68,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但正因如此  我不能永遠待在F4裡  我已經19歲了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.18,0:18:32.00,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我要早點做出成績  往下一個地方前進了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.01,0:18:35.24,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,結谷和加賀山都是好小伙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.36,0:18:37.69,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但他們不是我的朋友  而是對手
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.38,0:18:41.85,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我沒義務照顧他們  也沒有這個精力
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.65,0:18:43.92,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我做不到這一點
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.32,0:18:46.52,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,春永卻這麼做了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.27,0:18:50.77,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,他在賽後經常給他們提建議
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.08,0:18:54.17,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但他從來沒有跟我說過什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.43,0:18:58.01,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,因為不需要吧  他經常稱讚你跑得好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.06,0:19:03.21,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,別太著急了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.43,0:19:05.43,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,一號車手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.71,0:19:16.71,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\an7\frz10.09\pos(1106,80)\1a&H50}謝謝你  \NF4排位賽結束後我應該\N就能過去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.71,0:19:16.71,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\an7\frz9.846\pos(1036.4,292.4)\1a&H50}排位賽辛苦了！\N我也過去帳篷那邊了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.71,0:19:16.71,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\frz10.42\1a&H50\pos(1239.6,444.4)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.71,0:19:16.71,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\frz10.78\pos(1249.6,520.8)\1a&H50}比賽前的事抱歉了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.71,0:19:16.71,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1240.4,635.6)\frz10.28\1a&H50}錮太和叔叔都很擔心你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.71,0:19:16.71,overtake chat,,0,0,0,,{\frz9.95\pos(1296.8,728.8)\1a&H50}我現在到你家來了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.08,0:19:35.55,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,你在吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.29,0:19:38.18,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,你不開門也沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.53,0:19:42.66,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,如果你在的話  我希望你聽我說
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.39,0:19:51.21,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那個  我不知道該說什麼才好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.10,0:19:57.84,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,之前雨賽時你說的話  我十分感激
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.22,0:20:02.66,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但那個時候我什麼都不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.85,0:20:07.00,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,不僅是那次的事  迄今為止的事情也都是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.94,0:20:12.11,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,你突然跑過來  說什麼要支持我  做了一堆奇奇怪怪的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.75,0:20:15.42,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,沒想到卻真的幫我們找到了贊助
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.78,0:20:17.88,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我都很感謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.46,0:20:22.02,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,如果沒有你  沒有孝哉你的話
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.02,0:20:23.86,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,有些跑法我甚至無法做出來
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.36,0:20:29.03,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,如果是因為贊助的事情覺得無法面對我們
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.16,0:20:30.58,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,那些事情根本沒所謂的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.45,0:20:33.63,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,小牧叔叔和錮太都不在意這些
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.97,0:20:34.98,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我也完全…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.64,0:20:45.21,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.50,0:20:49.11,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,很抱歉現在才正式跟你道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.00,0:20:55.29,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,現在才理解那時候你為什麼阻止我  真的對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.58,0:20:59.19,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,明明我知道你以前發生過什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.06,0:21:01.31,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,卻仍然不理解你的做法  真的對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.46,0:21:05.47,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我知道我這麼說很自私
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.78,0:21:08.12,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,而且我也不知道現在自己到底能做到什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.13,0:21:11.05,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,但是那個約定
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.59,0:21:14.17,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,我獲勝的時候你要幫我拍照的約定
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.08,0:21:16.50,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,可以的話我還是想要實現它
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.00,0:21:22.54,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,孝哉？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.57,0:21:27.54,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,孝哉在嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.04,0:21:31.64,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.42,0:22:08.99,overtake - text,,0,0,0,,孝哉？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.51,0:22:11.01,overtake - title1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1088,625)}曝 光 不 足
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.51,0:22:11.01,overtake - title2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1118,881)}我的感受
Comment: 0,0:22:09.69,0:22:11.69,overtake ed jp,,0,0,0,template line,{\fad(300,300)}
Comment: 0,0:22:09.69,0:22:11.69,overtake ed cn,,0,0,0,template line,{\fad(300,300)}
Comment: 0,0:22:11.69,0:22:15.95,overtake ed jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,シグナルが青に変わる
Comment: 0,0:22:16.14,0:22:20.45,overtake ed jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,迷わずにアクセルを踏み込んで
Comment: 0,0:22:20.56,0:22:24.74,overtake ed jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,駆け抜けた　孤独な夜
Comment: 0,0:22:24.90,0:22:30.31,overtake ed jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,願いをのせた　一筋のShooting star light
Comment: 0,0:22:30.31,0:22:35.29,overtake ed jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,追い掛ける　僕らの夢
Comment: 0,0:22:37.74,0:22:46.22,overtake ed jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,ループする日常で知らずに擦り減らした心で
Comment: 0,0:22:46.43,0:22:54.66,overtake ed jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,まだ信じたい　不可能を可能に　なりふり構わずに
Comment: 0,0:22:54.66,0:23:03.40,overtake ed jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,平坦な道じゃない　後戻りをする事さえ容易じゃない
Comment: 0,0:23:03.40,0:23:12.52,overtake ed jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,「頑張った分だけちゃんと報われるといいのにな」ってキミが笑う
Comment: 0,0:23:12.88,0:23:17.21,overtake ed jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,疲れたらここへおいで
Comment: 0,0:23:17.21,0:23:25.98,overtake ed jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,スペアのない心で彷徨った眼差しに光が射す
Comment: 0,0:23:25.98,0:23:31.73,overtake ed jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,あの日の願いの行方を見届けよう
Comment: 0,0:23:31.74,0:23:37.01,overtake ed jp,,0,0,0,karaoke,向こう見ずな僕らのまま
Comment: 0,0:22:11.69,0:22:15.95,overtake ed cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,信號燈變為綠色
Comment: 0,0:22:16.14,0:22:20.45,overtake ed cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,毫不猶豫地踩下踏板
Comment: 0,0:22:20.56,0:22:24.74,overtake ed cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,穿過孤獨的夜晚
Comment: 0,0:22:24.90,0:22:30.31,overtake ed cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,承載著夢想  一股勁地像光一樣往前衝
Comment: 0,0:22:30.31,0:22:35.29,overtake ed cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,去追逐我們的夢想吧
Comment: 0,0:22:37.74,0:22:46.22,overtake ed cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,被無盡循環的日常悄然磨損著的內心
Comment: 0,0:22:46.43,0:22:54.66,overtake ed cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,不論如何仍然相信  能把不可能化為現實
Comment: 0,0:22:54.66,0:23:03.40,overtake ed cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,這不是平坦的道路  無法輕易回頭
Comment: 0,0:23:03.40,0:23:12.52,overtake ed cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,你笑著說道「希望付出的努力能得到回報」
Comment: 0,0:23:12.88,0:23:17.21,overtake ed cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果累了就到這裡來吧
Comment: 0,0:23:17.21,0:23:25.98,overtake ed cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,你的目光照亮了彷徨著的早已疲憊的內心
Comment: 0,0:23:25.98,0:23:31.73,overtake ed cn,,0,0,0,karaoke,去見證那一天許下的願望抵達的地方吧
